  "Retry": "Reintentar",
  "Demo data are currently shown.": "Se muestran datos de ejemplo.",
  "Species A–E and their coordinates are examples, not occurrence records. Upload your CSV to replace them.": "Species A–E y sus coordenadas son ejemplos, no registros reales. Sube tu CSV para reemplazarlos.",
  "Record table": "Tabla de registros",
